Here, there should be a clipvip_32.pt file, containing the clipvip_32 weights.

Download it automatically by running, from the repo root:
    uv run scripts/download_clipvip.py
    (or: python scripts/download_clipvip.py)

Or download it manually from the Hugging Face repo:
    https://huggingface.co/frotaur/clipvip-32-rlhfalife
    direct link: https://huggingface.co/frotaur/clipvip-32-rlhfalife/resolve/main/clipvip_32.pt
and place it next to this file as clipvip_32.pt

